      "es": "Quizás tampoco haya ternura en sus dedos, pero al menos ella da caña.",
      "en": "Maybe there's no tenderness in her fingertips either, but at least SHE puts out.",
      "noteEn": "This preserves the official English title text. The Spanish version uses dedos, literally “fingers,” and dar caña, a flexible colloquial expression for going hard or being intense, to carry the same sexually suggestive punchline."
